Article 7 (Restrictions on Conduct)
Any person using the Library (hereinafter referred to as a "user") shall not engage in any of the following acts:
1. Using library materials in a manner that infringes rights under the Copyright Act;
2. Damaging or destroying library materials, articles or facilities;
3. Eating food or smoking outside designated places;
4. Searching for or viewing obscene materials or other harmful information on the Library's information devices;
5. Violating any other requirements determined and publicly posted by the Director for maintaining order in the Library.
